00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.000
Noam Wolf: You too. Good morning.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.000
Whitney Hodges: Yes, I'm glad you were able to find a time that worked for you.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:25.000
Noam Wolf: Yeah, it worked for me when we scheduled it, and then today has been a little bit of a disaster in the morning, but I made it.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:45.000
Whitney Hodges: Oh, no. Okay. Well, I'm I'm glad you're you're here. And you know I've got a schedule for 30 min, so we'll kind of try to keep it within that timeframe. Certainly, if we need to schedule a follow up or anything like that, we totally can. The goal really of today's call is just to kind of get to know each other and each other's businesses a little bit.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.000
Noam Wolf: Okay.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.000
