00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:10.000
Whitney Hodges: may be right for you if needed. I know that we, uh, went back and forth via email a bit, you know, and chatted a bit about the accelerator program versus, um, Elevate. Um, so yeah, that's the… that's the plan for today.

