Noam Wolf: And, uh, and I'm just, like, I was doing it as a side hustle with my full-time job, which was very hard to advance that way. Now that I'm fully on it, I… I know that I have the operational side, and I know that I can sell. I'm… I'm a good closer, like, if I get…

