00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:36.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, and now they can, right? They're able to see through their Leadlock account, um, when leads are coming in from Google versus when leads are coming in through their Meta ads. Of course, you know, their organic leads are flowing through there, um, as well, right? And, and inside their Leadlock account, you know, we have the systems in place to help move clients from inquiry to booked consultation, like they're typically doing Zoom consultations.

