Noam Wolf: Okay.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:52.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, to, to close, um, those, those clients. Yes. So, yeah, it's working amazingly, um, for them. Um, like I said, that is, you know, one of, like, our full-service clients, but I know that, you know, we've talked as well about, um, the accelerator programs.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.000
Noam Wolf: Right.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:16:08.000
Whitney Hodges: Um that that we have. And um. You know, depending on kind of like what you're thinking, and how hands on you want to continue being, you know, with running the Google ads and running the Meta ads. I think that could potentially be a really viable option for you as well. You know, you've already seen really.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:23.000
Whitney Hodges: early success, it sounds like, with the Google Ads and with the… the Meta Ads, um… but I… I can tell, and I know what it feels like, right, when you're just kind of flying blind a little bit, or, like, something's working, and then it stops working, and you don't really know why.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:37.000
Noam Wolf: Not only that, it was a short success and then I had to go in and optimize it and then something changed. Now it's in bid learning strategy for a while and nothing is coming in. Suddenly there's no views, how do you call it? Impressions.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Mm-hmm.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:48.000
Noam Wolf: Um, and… and I don't know what I've done. I don't know what we changed. Like, I already have 5 different campaigns that I built. Like, I need someone to… I think what I need first is an audit.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, mm-hmm.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:17:04.000
Noam Wolf: Someone to look at everything that I have, all the campaigns that I have and tell me, okay, this is good. This is not like, let's change the keywords, the negative words. They're clashing. They're not, I don't know, like take a look at what I have, including the landing pages that I built. I have like one for weddings, one for corporate.

